<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000523> a skos:Concept;
  dc:identifier "homoit0000523";
  dc:issued "2019-05-14"^^xsd:date;
  dc:modified "2025-02-23"^^xsd:date;
  dc:replaces <http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayPrideWeek>;
  rdfs:comment "A period of public recognition and celebration of LGBTQ+ people and culture, usually organized over the course of a week with local events, parades, marches, and rallies. Gay pride week occurs at different times during the year in different places but is typically held in June in the United States to commemorate the Stonewall uprising.",
    "Eventos que celebran la autoaceptación y la aceptación social, los logros y los derechos LGBTQ+, generalmente organizados en el transcurso de una semana con eventos locales, desfiles, marchas y concentraciones. Ocurre en diferentes momentos del año en diferentes lugares, pero normalmente se lleva a cabo en junio para conmemorar las revueltas de Stonewall.";
  skos:altLabel "Pink Saturday",
    "Pink Week",
    "Pride Week",
    "Sábado rosado",
    "Sábado rosa",
    "Semana rosa",
