  dc:modified "2025-04-17"^^xsd:date;
  dc:replaces <http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQImprisonment>;
  rdfs:comment "The restraint of an LGBTQ+ person's liberty against their will, with or without legal process, whether by a government authority, institution, or extrajudicial actors. Generally, this refers to physical and/or legal confinement within a jail, prison, detention center, etc. It may also include the forced confinement of LGBTQ+ people within hospitals and other healthcare facilities.",
    "Confinamiento, incluida la restricción física y/o legal, de personas LGBTQ+ por parte de una institución o autoridad. Típicamente se utiliza para describir el confinamiento en una prisión pública o privada sentenciado por un tribunal dentro de un sistema penal.";
  skos:altLabel "LGBTQ+ imprisonment",
    "Incarceration (LGBTQ)",
    "Imprisonment (LGBTQ)",
    "Encarcelamiento LGBTQ";
  skos:broader <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000348>;
