    <http://homosaurus.org/v2/cheating>,
    <http://homosaurus.org/v2/nonConsensualNonMonogamy>;
  rdfs:comment "A violation of a couple's assumed or stated contract regarding emotional and/or sexual exclusivity. Should not be used to refer to non-monogamy in general, as cheating is possible in both monogamous and non-monogamous relationships.",
    "Practice of engaging in romantic or sexual relationships with more than one person simultaneously without each partner's consent.",
    "Práctica de entablar relaciones románticas o sexuales con más de una persona simultáneamente sin el consentimiento de cada pareja.";
