  dc:modified "2025-02-23"^^xsd:date;
  rdfs:comment "Term that encompasses lesbian filmmaking, the lesbian film industry, and film as an art form within lesbian culture. For specific movies created by or representing lesbians, use the term \"Lesbian films.\"",
