<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000530> a skos:Concept;
  dc:identifier "homoit0000530",
    "homoit0000774",
    "homoit0001003";
  dc:isReplacedBy <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0000530>;
  dc:issued "2019-05-14"^^xsd:date;
  dc:modified "2026-02-23"^^xsd:date,
    "2022-08-22"^^xsd:date,
    "2022-08-15"^^xsd:date;
  dc:replaces <http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayReligiousGroups>,
    <http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbianReligiousGroups>,
    <http://homosaurus.org/v2/metropolitanCommunityChurch>;
  rdfs:comment "Groups of people united by a religion or religious practices that are accepting and supportive of LGBTQ+ people and their identities. Includes large-scale organized groups, such as denominations or sects, as well as small-scale groups, such as specific churches, mosques, temples, or congregations.",
    "Grupos de personas unidas por una religión o prácticas religiosas que aceptan y apoyan a las personas LGBTQ+ y sus identidades. Incluye a grupos organizados a gran escala, como denominaciones o sectas, así como grupos de pequeña escala, como iglesias, mezquitas, templos o congregaciones específicas.",
    "Christian church founded in 1968 by Troy Perry as a welcoming spiritual gathering place for LGBT Christians; MCC is now an international denomination";
  skos:altLabel "Gay religious groups",
    "Lesbian religious groups",
    "LGBTQ+ affirming religious groups",
    "LGBTQ+ inclusive religious groups",
    "LGBTQ+-inclusive religious groups",
    "MCC";
  skos:broader <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000753>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000530>;
  skos:changeNote "Version 4.1.0";
  skos:hasTopConcept <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000530>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001322>;
  skos:inScheme <https://homosaurus.org/v3>;
  skos:prefLabel "LGBTQ+-affirming religious groups",
    "Grupos religiosos que afirman las identidades LGBTQ+",
    "Lesbian religious groups",
    "Metropolitan Community Church";
  skos:related <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003609>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001137> .

<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000534> a skos:Concept;
  dc:identifier "homoit0000534";
  dc:issued "2019-05-14"^^xsd:date;
  dc:modified "2025-02-23"^^xsd:date;
  dc:replaces <http://homosaurus.org/v2/gayShame>;
  rdfs:comment "Movement within queer communities that is described as a radical alternative to gay culture being brought into the mainstream; directly posits an alternative view of gay pride events and activities that rejects increasing commercialization, corporate sponsors, and \"safer\" agendas to avoid offending heterosexual supporters and sponsors.",
    "Movimiento dentro de comunidades queer que se describe como una alternativa radical a la incorporación de la cultura gay a la corriente principal; postula directamente una visión alternativa a los eventos y actividades del orgullo gay que rechaza su creciente comercialización, los patrocinadores corporativos y las agendas \"más seguras\" que evitan ofender a partidarios y patrocinadores heterosexuales.";
  skos:changeNote "Version 4.1.0";
  skos:hasTopConcept <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000534>;
  skos:inScheme <https://homosaurus.org/v3>;
  skos:prefLabel "Gay shame",
    "Vergüenza gay";
  skos:related <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000006>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001561> .

