  dc:modified "2025-02-23"^^xsd:date;
  rdfs:comment "The original name for AIDS, proposed after public health scientists noticed clusters of Kaposi's sarcoma and Pneumocystis pneumonia among gay men in California and New York City. Should only be used in historical contexts.",
