<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000438> a skos:Concept;
  dc:identifier "homoit0000438";
  dc:issued "2019-05-14"^^xsd:date;
  dc:modified "2025-02-23"^^xsd:date;
  dc:replaces <http://homosaurus.org/v2/womensMovement>;
  rdfs:comment "Social and political movement originating in the 1800s for reforms on women’s issues stemming from social, cultural, political, and economic inequality between men and women. Feminist issues include reproductive rights, women’s liberation, and equal pay. This term encompasses the women’s movement in its entirety, including different waves of feminist thought and activism.",
    "Movimiento social y político que se originó en el siglo XIX para reformar asuntos de las mujeres derivados de la desigualdad social, cultural, política y económica entre hombres y mujeres. Los asuntos feministas incluyen los derechos reproductivos, la liberación de la mujer y la igualdad salarial. Este término abarca el movimiento de mujeres en su totalidad, incluidas diferentes olas de pensamiento y activismo feminista.";
  skos:altLabel "Feminist movement",
    "Women's movement",
    "Movimiento feminista";
  skos:broader <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001322>;
  skos:changeNote "Version 4.1.0";
  skos:exactMatch <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85047741>;
  skos:hasTopConcept <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001322>;
  skos:inScheme <https://homosaurus.org/v3>;
  skos:prefLabel "Women's movement",
    "Movimiento de mujeres";
  skos:related <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000437>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000753>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002290> .

