    "An international sport and cultural event held by the Federation of Gay Games since 1982 that promotes acceptance of LGBTQ+ people and features LGBTQ+ athletes, artists, and other individuals",
    "Organized games or sports activities for LGBTQ+ people or communities; includes both competitive and recreational events.",
    "Juegos o actividades deportivas organizadas para personas o comunidades LGBTQ+; incluye eventos competitivos y recreativos.",
