<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001901> a skos:Concept;
  dc:identifier "homoit0001901";
  dc:issued "2022-02-28"^^xsd:date;
  dc:modified "2025-02-23"^^xsd:date;
  rdfs:comment "The ability of a person who is not heterosexual to \"pass,\" or be accepted or regarded as heterosexual by others. \"Passing\" has historically been used to describe an individual's ability to \"pass\" as a certain race or ethnicity, though the term was later appropriated by the LGBTQ+ community.",
    "La capacidad de una persona que no es heterosexual de \"pasar\", ser aceptada o considerada heterosexual por otras personas. \"Pasar\" se ha utilizado históricamente para describir la capacidad de una persona de \"pasar\" como una determinada raza o etnia, aunque eventualmente la comunidad LGBTQ+ se apropió del término.";
  skos:altLabel "Passing (Sexual identity)",
    "Passing (Sexual orientation)",
    "Pasando",
    "Pasar desapercibido";
  skos:changeNote "Version 4.1.0";
  skos:hasTopConcept <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001901>;
  skos:inScheme <https://homosaurus.org/v3>;
  skos:prefLabel "Passing (Sexuality)",
    "Passing (sexualidad)";
  skos:related <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001090>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001295>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001306> .

<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001914> a skos:Concept;
  dc:identifier "homoit0001914";
  dc:issued "2022-03-29"^^xsd:date;
  dc:modified "2025-02-23"^^xsd:date;
  rdfs:comment "Identity term used by Indigenous people in North America to reconnect with the multiple gender and sexual roles in Indigenous cultures.",
    "Término de identidad utilizado por las comunidades indígenas de Norteamérica para reconectar con los múltiples roles de género y sexuales de las culturas indígenas.";
  skos:altLabel "2S identity",
    "Two Spirit identity",
    "Two Spirited identity",
    "Two-Spirited identity";
  skos:broader <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000322>;
  skos:changeNote "Version 4.1.0";
  skos:hasTopConcept <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000560>;
  skos:inScheme <https://homosaurus.org/v3>;
  skos:prefLabel "Two-Spirit identity",
    "Identidad dos espíritus";
  skos:related <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000098>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001037>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002581> .

