<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002177> a skos:Concept;
  dc:identifier "homoit0002177";
  dc:issued "2022-07-04"^^xsd:date;
  dc:modified "2025-02-23"^^xsd:date;
  rdfs:comment "The homoerotic fan pairing of Kirk and Spock from Star Trek: The Original Series. The Kirk/Spock fandom originated much of the terminology and practices associated with fandom today--for example, the word \"slash\" comes from the forward slash in Kirk/Spock.",
    "El emparejamiento homoerótico por fans de Kirk y Spock de \"Star Trek: The Original Series\". El fandom de Kirk/Spock originó gran parte de la terminología y las prácticas asociadas con el fandom actual; por ejemplo, la palabra \"slash\" proviene de la barra diagonal en Kirk/Spock.";
  skos:altLabel "K/S",
    "Spirk";
  skos:broader <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002198>;
  skos:changeNote "Version 4.1.0";
  skos:hasTopConcept <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001345>;
  skos:inScheme <https://homosaurus.org/v3>;
  skos:prefLabel "Kirk/Spock";
  skos:related <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000934>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001806>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002187> .

