    "2025-04-24"^^xsd:date;
  dc:replaces <http://homosaurus.org/v2/sobriety>;
  rdfs:comment "Conscious abstinence from addictive or mind-altering substances, typically alcohol or drugs.",
    "LGBTQ+ people intentionally refraining from substance use (typically drugs or alcohol). Follow the individual's preference for \"sobriety\" or \"recovery\" whenever possible.",
    "Personas LGBTQ+ que se abstienen intencionalmente de consumir sustancias (usualmente drogas o alcohol). Siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"sobriedad\" o  \"recuperación\" siempre que sea posible.";
  skos:altLabel "LGBTQ+ sober people",
