    "Personas LGBTQ+ que practican la sobriedad";
  skos:related <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001235>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001551>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0004231> .

