  skos:related <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000620>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000631>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003509> .

<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003487> a skos:Concept;
