  dc:issued "2024-07-31"^^xsd:date;
  dc:modified "2025-02-23"^^xsd:date;
  rdfs:comment "Two Spirit youth between the ages of 12-18 who have experienced bullying due to their gender or sexual identity and may or may not have survived; follow the individual's preference for \"victims\" or \"survivors\" whenever possible.";
