<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000656> a skos:Concept;
  dc:identifier "homoit0000656";
  dc:issued "2019-05-14"^^xsd:date;
  dc:modified "2025-02-23"^^xsd:date;
  dc:replaces <http://homosaurus.org/v2/hypersexuality>;
  rdfs:comment "Term used to describe a level or frequency of sexual desire that is perceived as excessive within a given culture. Though the medical community has not reached a consensus as to whether hypersexuality should be included as a clinical diagnosis, doctors and psychologists have historically diagnosed LGBTQ+ people with hypersexuality (or other related labels) in order to wrongly treat their identities and desires as medical disorders. Should only be used in a historical context or if an individual self-identifies with the term.",
    "Término utilizado para describir un nivel o una frecuencia de deseo sexual que se percibe como excesiva dentro de una cultura determinada. Aunque la comunidad médica no ha llegado a un consenso sobre si la hipersexualidad debe incluirse como diagnóstico clínico, históricamente los médicos y psicólogos han diagnosticado a personas LGBTQ+ con hipersexualidad (u otras etiquetas relacionadas) para tratar erróneamente sus identidades y deseos como trastornos médicos. Utilícese únicamente en un contexto histórico o si una persona se identifica con el término.";
  skos:altLabel "Nymphomania",
    "Satyriasis",
    "Andromania",
    "Clitoromania",
    "Don Juan syndrome",
    "Don Juanism",
    "Estromania",
    "Excessive sex drive",
    "Furor amatorius",
    "Furor uterinus",
    "Hyper-sexuality",
    "Hyperactive sexual desire disorder",
    "Hyperaesthesia",
    "Hypereroticism",
    "Hyperlibido",
    "Hyperphilia",
    "Hypersensuality",
    "Hypersexual disorder",
    "Messalina syndrome",
    "Œstromania",
    "Oversexuality",
    "Satyrism",
    "Satyromania",
    "Sexual hyperesthesia",
    "Sexual hyperversion";
  skos:changeNote "Version 4.1.0";
  skos:hasTopConcept <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000656>;
  skos:inScheme <https://homosaurus.org/v3>;
  skos:narrower <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001284>;
  skos:prefLabel "Hypersexuality",
    "Hipersexualidad";
  skos:related <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001283>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001306>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001538> .

