<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002152> a skos:Concept;
  dc:identifier "homoit0002152";
  dc:issued "2022-07-04"^^xsd:date;
  dc:modified "2025-02-23"^^xsd:date;
  rdfs:comment "The manga and anime genre of fictional male-male romance created for a primarily female audience; sometimes used interchangeably with \"Yaoi\" in English (but not in Japanese).",
