<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002381> a skos:Concept;
  dc:identifier "homoit0002381";
  dc:issued "2023-01-13"^^xsd:date;
  dc:modified "2025-02-23"^^xsd:date;
  rdfs:comment "Unexpected and unannounced entry into and searches of establishments owned or frequented by LGBTQ+ people by law enforcement officers with the aim of using surprise to seize evidence or arrest suspects. Police raids may be undertaken legally using a search warrant or through exigent circumstances, such as probable cause, though the latter is highly subjective and civilians often have little resources to appeal illegal raids.",
    "Un registro no anunciado y sin orden judicial de una residencia o un establecimiento principalmente afiliado o relacionado con comunidades o identidades LGBTQ+ por parte de la policía. Estos ataques suelen ser traumáticos y caóticos y pueden eludir los procedimientos penales típicos y las libertades civiles.";
  skos:altLabel "Anti-LGBTQ+ police raids",
    "Police raids on LGBTQ+ establishments",
    "Police raids on LGBTQ+ venues",
    "Police raids to LGBTQ+ venues",
    "Redadas policiales anti-LGBTQ+",
    "Redadas policiales en establecimientos LGBTQ+",
    "Redadas policiales en lugares LGBTQ+";
  skos:broader <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001122>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002378>;
  skos:changeNote "Version 4.1.0";
  skos:hasTopConcept <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000611>;
  skos:inScheme <https://homosaurus.org/v3>;
  skos:narrower <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002382>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002383>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002384>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002385>;
  skos:prefLabel "Police raids on LGBTQ+-related establishments",
    """Redadas policiales en establecimientos relacionados con comunidades LGBTQ+|| 
Redadas policiales en establecimientos relacionados con identidades LGBTQ+""";
  skos:related <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001735>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001741> .

