<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001540> a skos:Concept;
  dc:identifier "homoit0001528",
    "homoit0001530",
    "homoit0001540";
  dc:isReplacedBy <https://homosaurus.org/v3/homoit0001540>;
  dc:issued "2020-06-02"^^xsd:date,
    "2020-06-03"^^xsd:date;
  dc:modified "2022-08-22"^^xsd:date,
    "2025-04-24"^^xsd:date;
  dc:replaces <http://homosaurus.org/v2/alcoholics>,
    <http://homosaurus.org/v2/alcoholism>,
    <http://homosaurus.org/v2/LGBTQAlcoholics>;
  rdfs:comment "Individuals who are addicted to alcohol or have alcohol dependencies",
    "LGBTQ+ people who have been diagnosed with or regard themselves as having an alcohol use disorder, a medical condition that involves a pattern of alcohol use that is difficult to control, negatively impacts the individual's life, and results in withdrawal symptoms upon cessation. Only use to refer to individuals who describe themselves as having an alcohol use disorder. Follow the individual's preference for \"use disorder\" or \"addiction\" whenever possible.",
    "Personas LGBTQ+ que han sido diagnosticadas o que reconocen que tienen un trastorno por consumo de alcohol, una condición médica que implica un patrón de consumo de alcohol difícil de controlar, que afecta negativamente la vida de la persona y que provoca síntomas de abstinencia al dejar de consumirlo. Utilícese únicamente para referirse a personas que se describen a sí mismas como padeciendo de un trastorno por consumo de alcohol. Siga la preferencia de la persona sobre el uso de \"trastorno por consumo\" o \"adicción\" siempre que sea posible.";
  skos:altLabel "Alcoholics (LGBTQ)",
    "LGBTQ+ alcoholics",
    "Alcohólicos (LGBTQ)",
    "Alcohólicos LGBTQ+",
    "LGBTQ+ alcohólicos";
  skos:broader <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000379>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001550>;
  skos:changeNote "Version 4.1.0";
  skos:hasTopConcept <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001540>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000915>;
  skos:inScheme <https://homosaurus.org/v3>;
  skos:narrower <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001540>;
  skos:prefLabel "Alcoholics ",
    "Alcoholism",
    "LGBTQ+ people with alcohol use disorders",
    "Personas LGBTQ+ con trastornos por consumo de alcohol";
  skos:related <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001540>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000256>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001083>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002227>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001551>,
