<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002038> a skos:Concept;
  dc:identifier "homoit0002038";
  dc:issued "2022-06-15"^^xsd:date;
  dc:modified "2025-02-23"^^xsd:date;
  rdfs:comment "The belief that groups of human beings possess different inherent behavioral traits that correspond to inherited attributes and can be divided based on the superiority of one race over another. This term also encompasses prejudice, discrimination, and antagonism (whether personal or systematic) directed against other people because of their race and its perceived inferiority.",
    "La creencia de que grupos de seres humanos poseen diferentes rasgos de comportamiento inherentes que corresponden a atributos heredados y que pueden dividirse en función de la superioridad de una raza sobre otra. Este término también abarca prejuicios, discriminación y antagonismo (ya sea personal o sistemático) dirigido contra otras personas debido a su raza y su percibida inferioridad.";
  skos:changeNote "Version 4.1.0";
  skos:exactMatch <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85110266>;
  skos:hasTopConcept <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002038>;
  skos:inScheme <https://homosaurus.org/v3>;
  skos:narrower <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002194>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002257>;
  skos:prefLabel "Racism",
    "Racismo";
  skos:related <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001902>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001903>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001904>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002269>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002270>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002271>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002272>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003691>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0003692> .

<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002579> a skos:Concept;
  dc:identifier "homoit0002579";
  dc:issued "2023-04-12"^^xsd:date;
  dc:modified "2025-02-23"^^xsd:date;
  rdfs:comment "Umbrella term for different forms of creative activity dealing with or engaging with erotic themes, including visual, material, and performing art, by LGBTQ+ artists or about LGBTQ+ topics and communities. Use a more specific term if possible.",
    "Término general para diferentes formas de actividad creativa que tratan o interactúan con temas eróticos, incluido el arte visual, material y escénico, por parte de artistas LGBTQ+ o sobre temas y comunidades LGBTQ+. Utilícese un término más específico de ser posible.";
  skos:broader <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000816>;
  skos:changeNote "Version 4.1.0";
  skos:exactMatch <http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh85044668>;
  skos:hasTopConcept <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0001345>;
  skos:inScheme <https://homosaurus.org/v3>;
  skos:narrower <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000013>,
    <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0002607>,
