<https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000556> a skos:Concept;
  dc:identifier "homoit0000556";
  dc:issued "2019-05-14"^^xsd:date;
  dc:modified "2025-04-29"^^xsd:date;
  dc:replaces <http://homosaurus.org/v2/lesbians>;
  rdfs:comment "Individuals who self-identify as lesbian and belong to lesbian communities. The term has been predominately used to describe women who are exclusively or primarily romantically and/or sexually attracted to other women. However, not all lesbians are women, and gender non-conforming people who belong to lesbian communities have often identified as lesbian.",
    "Personas que se identifican como lesbianas y pertenecen a comunidades lesbianas. El término se ha utilizado predominantemente para describir a mujeres que se sienten exclusiva o principalmente atraídas romántica y/o sexualmente por otras mujeres. Sin embargo, no todas las lesbianas son mujeres, y las personas disidentes de género que pertenecen a comunidades lésbicas a menudo se han identificado como lesbianas.";
  skos:altLabel "Gay women",
    "Lesbian women",
    "Lesbian people",
    "Mujeres gay",
    "Personas lesbianas",
    "Mujeres lesbianas";
  skos:broader <https://homosaurus.org/v4/homoit0000915>,
