  rdfs:comment "Antagonism or disgust directed towards LGBTQ+ identities or people due to their sexuality or gender, perceived or actual. LGBTQ+ phobia can include denial of the existence of certain LGBTQ+ identities, stereotypes, verbal harassment, and physical violence.",
    "Antagonismo o disgusto dirigido hacia identidades o personas LGBTQ+ debido a su sexualidad o género, percibido o real. La fobia LGBTQ+ puede incluir la negación de la existencia de ciertas identidades LGBTQ+, estereotipos, acoso verbal y violencia física.";
  skos:altLabel "LGBTQ phobia",
